    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.03_silmaril_federation.chapters.flat.sections.03_federation_contract.concrete_anchor.node2" .
silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_03_federation_contract_concrete_anchor_node2 silm:hasLongDescription "The 03_federation_contractOperationNode is The operation or gate node for 03_federation_contract. FedContract for Mittens: (VetRecord_Mittens message, ECDSA-sig, lambda_evidence) -> ACCEPT. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Operation or gate', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
